{"assets":["/statement-assets/93b88ea82b759d54ce726289a628eca8b0a3653bee72e4a962a9d16a73ab4edc.png","/statement-assets/d644f5cb1fe60050fb1eb8dd95ecd401ef7e63dfc73e257386d6fcf35965d2e7.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1797","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Li Hua and Chess"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is an interactive problem."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Li Ming and Li Hua are playing a game. Li Hua has a chessboard of size $$$n\\times m$$$. Denote $$$(r, c)$$$ ($$$1\\le r\\le n, 1\\le c\\le m$$$) as the cell on the $$$r$$$-th row from the top and on the $$$c$$$-th column from the left. Li Ming put a king on the chessboard and Li Hua needs to guess its position."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Li Hua can ask Li Ming "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"no more than $$$3$$$"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" questions. In each question, he can choose a cell and ask the minimum steps needed to move the king to the chosen cell. Each question is independent, which means the king doesn't actually move."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A king can move from $$$(x,y)$$$ to $$$(x',y')$$$ if and only if $$$\\max\\{|x-x'|,|y-y'|\\}=1$$$ (shown in the following picture)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/93b88ea82b759d54ce726289a628eca8b0a3653bee72e4a962a9d16a73ab4edc.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The position of the king is chosen "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"before"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" the interaction."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Suppose you were Li Hua, please solve this problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"custom","title":"Interaction"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Interaction"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^3$$$). "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n,m$$$ ($$$1\\le n,m\\le 10^9$$$) — the size of the chessboard, and then the interaction begins."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To ask a question, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$r$$$ $$$c$$$\" (without quotes, $$$1 \\leq r \\leq n, 1 \\leq c \\leq m$$$). Then you should input the response from standard input — the minimum steps the king needs to move to the chosen cell."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If your program has asked an invalid question or has run out of questions, the interactor will terminate immediately and your program will get a verdict "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wrong answer"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To give the final answer, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"!"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$r$$$ $$$c$$$\" (without the quotes, $$$(r,c)$$$ is the king's initial coordinate). Note that giving this answer is not counted towards the limit of $$$3$$$ questions."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After asking a question do not forget to output the end of line and flush the output. Otherwise, you will get "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Idleness limit exceeded"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". To do this, use:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"fflush(stdout)"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cout.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in C++; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"System.out.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Java; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"flush(output)"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Pascal; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"stdout.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Python; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" see the documentation for other languages. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Hacks"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To hack, use the following format."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line should contain a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^3$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first and only line of each test case should contain four integers $$$n,m,r,c$$$ ($$$1\\le r\\le n\\le 10^9,1\\le c\\le m\\le 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n3 4\n\n1\n\n2\n\n5 3\n\n3\n\n1\n\n2"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n\n\n? 2 3\n\n? 2 4\n\n! 2 2\n\n? 2 2\n\n? 5 2\n\n? 5 3\n\n! 5 1"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In test case 1, the king is at $$$(2,2)$$$. It takes $$$1$$$ step to move to $$$(2,3)$$$ and $$$2$$$ steps to move to $$$(2,4)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/d644f5cb1fe60050fb1eb8dd95ecd401ef7e63dfc73e257386d6fcf35965d2e7.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that the questions may not seem sensible. They are just a sample of questions you may ask."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1797C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1797/problem/C"}